<title>DENMARK: FORECAST-Danish unemployment at 7.8 pct end-1997.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Danish unemployment at 7.8 pct end-1997.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Economy Ministry on Tuesday said it downwardly adjusted its estimates for 1997 unemployment to 7.8 percent of the workforce at end-1997, with the jobless total at end-1998 at 7.4 percent.</p>
<p>In its previous report last December, the ministry forecast 8.0 percent unemployed at end-1997, falling to 7.6 percent at end-1998.</p>
<p>In 1996, Denmark had an average 8.8 percent unemployment rate, corresponding to 245,600 jobless. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
